ation\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using an export variable of type Resource in a GDScript, clicking the Load button in the Inspector opens a file dialog that shows a list of supported file types. However, .ogv files are not listed—even though they are supported. Users must select “All Files (*)” to choose an .ogv file, which is inconsistent with the handling of other file types. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene and attach a script containing the following line:\n    `@export var my_resource:Resource`\n\n3. Save the scene and view the Inspector.\n4. Click the Load button next to my_resource.\n5. In the file dialog’s file type dropdown, note that .ogv files are missing.\n6. Switch to “All Files (*)” and select an .ogv file to load it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[resource-export-file-dialog-does-not-list-.ogv-files.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18824911/resource-export-file-dialog-does-not-list-.ogv-files.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use